; A tiny BT-IS program.
;
; Demonstrates that the geometric primitives compose:
;   - Load the +X axis
;   - Rotate it 90 deg about +Z -> +Y
;   - Rotate that 90 deg about +X -> +Z
;   - Reflect through YZ plane -> -Z
;   - Apply negation -> +Z
;   - Output final cube
;
; A program is a trajectory through cube state space.

load_axis X
rot_z_90
rot_x_90
reflect_x
neg
outc
halt
